+ # Agents — Register, List, and Switch Agents
+ Manage agents registered on the server. An agent must exist before running any other command.
+ ## Register an agent
+ ```bash
+ ```bash
+ ```bash
+ ```bash
+ ```bash
+ lobstercash agents register --name "<name>" [--description "<desc>"] [--image-url "<url>"]
+ ```
